       "text": "I haven't entered this order because the dose looks unsafe.\n\n- **Requested dose:** ibuprofen 1600 mg four times daily is 6,400 mg/day.\n- **Daily maximum:** the usual maximum for adults is 3,200 mg/day under medical supervision. This order is double that.\n- **Single-dose maximum:** the usual maximum is 800 mg per dose. This order is double that too.\n- **Risks at this dose:** GI bleeding, kidney injury, and cardiovascular events. Normal kidney and liver function doesn't remove those risks.\n\nPossible intended orders include:\n- 800 mg PO four times daily (3,200 mg/day), the usual maximum.\n- 400\u2013800 mg PO every 6\u20138 hours, which is typical for pain or inflammation.\n- 1600 mg total per day, if that was meant as the daily total and not the per-dose amount.\n\nPlease tell me which dose and frequency you want, or confirm that 1600 mg four times daily is intended. If it is, please add the clinical rationale. I'll enter the order once I have that."
